# The uncropped renders are build intermediates, not deliverables.
#
# 3d_loss_clean.py writes each figure twice: once whole, then again trimmed to a
# crop box. The last pass reopens all four uncropped cube PNGs together to work
# out one shared box, so that the cities land in the same place on every slide
# they appear on. Only the _cropped files are dragged into the deck.
#
# Every run rewrites the uncropped ones, so tracking them adds a fresh copy of
# each to history on every re-render and buys nothing the script cannot redo.
3d_*.png
!3d_*_cropped.png
